 src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0734.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0735.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0735.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0736.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0736.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0737.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0737.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0738.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0738.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0739.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0739.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0740.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0740.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0741.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0741.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0742.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0742.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0743.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0743.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><p>FYI Yachts recently partnered with <a href=\"https://www.strollmag.com/locations/cocoplum-fl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stroll Cocoplum</a> to host an exclusive Gentlemen’s Night Out, a sophisticated evening of luxury, networking, and unparalleled experiences on the water. This extraordinary event was proudly sponsored by <a href=\"https://www.v2jets.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">V2 Jets</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://ondemandluxe.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OnDemand Luxe</a> and curated by the world-renowned <a href=\"https://www.colincowie.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Colin Cowie Lifestyle</a>.</p><p>Set aboard our stunning 105 Azimut, guests were treated to breathtaking views of Miami’s shimmering skyline while indulging in an evening designed for the modern gentleman. The ambiance was elevated by exquisite bites meticulously prepared by Inspired Events, an array of fine spirits, and immersive brand activations by <a href=\"https://thebespokeclubusa.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Bespoke Club</a> and <a href=\"https://ondemandluxe.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OnDemand Luxe</a>. Every detail was thoughtfully crafted to ensure a night of elegance, indulgence, and meaningful connections.</p><p>Attendees enjoyed sophisticated networking opportunities, gourmet hors d’oeuvres, and premium cocktails, all while soaking in the unparalleled luxury that FYI Yachts is known for. The event was a testament to our commitment to providing world-class experiences that extend far beyond yachting.</p><p>At FYI Yachts, we take pride in curating and hosting exceptional yachting experiences that go beyond expectations. Whether it’s high-profile events like this or private luxury charters, we ensure every moment on board is one to remember.</p><p><strong>Looking to host your own exclusive event on a luxury yacht?</strong> <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Contact FYI Yachts</a> today to explore our fleet and plan your next unforgettable experience on the water.</p><p>Published on: March 11, 2025</p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/m1RdsEuA5Bk?si=GHp2vaP1rZsjQA2T&amp;controls=0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe><b>Share this post</b><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffyiyachts.com%2Fan-unforgettable-evening-fyi-yachts-stroll-cocoplums-gentlemens-night-out%2F&amp;src=sdkpreparse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/tweet?url=https://fyiyachts.com/an-unforgettable-evening-fyi-yachts-stroll-cocoplums-gentlemens-night-out/%2F&amp;src=sdkpreparse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Check out this post&amp;body=https://fyiyachts.com/an-unforgettable-evening-fyi-yachts-stroll-cocoplums-gentlemens-night-out/%2F&amp;src=sdkpreparse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a>"}